                <span class="section-tag"> ABOUT MOBILITY MASTERS </span>

                <h2 class="about-title">
                  Helping You Move
                  <span>Better, Live Better</span>
                </h2>

                <p class="about-description">
                  At Mobility Masters, we are dedicated to providing specialized
                  physiotherapy and rehabilitation services in Viman Nagar,
                  Pune. Led by Dr. Sandeep Sharma, we focus on personalized care
                  to help individuals manage pain, restore mobility and improve
                  their quality of life.
                </p>

                <p class="about-description">
                  With a holistic approach and advanced treatment techniques, we
                  support patients through their recovery journey, addressing
                  musculoskeletal conditions, sports injuries and mobility
                  challenges.
                </p>

                <!-- Highlights -->
                <div class="about-highlights">
                  <div class="highlight-item">
                    <span class="highlight-icon">&#10003;</span>
                    <span>Personalized Rehabilitation Plans</span>
